## 3. PROPOSED TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE
* **Mobile Application:** **React Native (Expo)** compiled for **Android** (`.apk`/`.aab`) and **iOS** (`.ipa`), optimized for low memory usage and low-cost smartphones.
* **Web Admin Dashboard:** **Next.js (React)** styled with Tailwind CSS, built for fast operation on desktop laptops and office tablets.
* **Backend API & Real-Time Sync:** **Node.js (NestJS)** utilizing WebSockets to broadcast live rider coordinates directly to the web dashboard map without refreshing the page.
* **Database & Location Cache:** **PostgreSQL** for persistent delivery records and driver profiles, paired with **Redis** for sub-second coordinate storage.
* **Cost-Controlled Geospatial Mapping:** Open-source tile rendering (OpenStreetMap / Leaflet) to eliminate expensive recurring Google Maps API bills.

